      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Muhammad Bin Yahya, from Ahmad Bin Muhammad, from Abdullah Bin Muhammad Al Hajjal, from Sa’alba, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Ubeyd Bin Zurara who heard Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> saying: ‘When the man says to his slave girl, ‘I emancipate you and marry you, and make your dower to be your emancipation’, so it is allowed’."
        ]
